# ── Repo-wide line-ending normalization ──────────────────────────────────────
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows otherwise rewrites committed LF files to CRLF in
# the working tree → phantom "modified" churn plus CRLF-sensitive tooling bugs.
# text=auto detects text vs binary; eol=lf forces LF in the working tree on every
# platform. LF is valid for manifest.json / versions.json / styles.css and is the
# Obsidian-conventional default — no impact on the community plugin review.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep genuine binaries untouched (no eol munging, no diff).
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
